Technique: T1486
Tactic: Impact
Data Source: FileCreationEvents

Behavior:
Multiple files are created with an encryption-related extension.

Detection Logic:
10+ .encrypted files created on the same host.

False Positives:
Legitimate encryption/compression software.

Severity:
High

Detection
FileCreationEvents
| where filename endswith ".encrypted"
| summarize EncryptedFiles=count() by hostname
| where EncryptedFiles >= 10
